		"Id": "mechdef_blackknight_BL-DF-KNT",
		"Name": "Defender",
		"Details": "Developed for a MechWarrior in the grips of a serious ailment, Defender stands as a tribute to their resilience in the face of adversity. Similarly, the 'Mech itself is surprisingly durable for a Black Knight, sporting nearly maxed out Ferro-Lamellor armor, a Heavy Duty Gyro, a standard fusion engine, Armored Core Myomer, and a Torso DNI Cockpit. For firepower, Defender carries a wild array of advanced and exotic energy weapons, including a Static PPC, Rotary ER Small Laser, Streak Medium Lasers, and more besides. If you need a 'Mech to stand with you in tough times, you could do much worse than Defender.\n\n <b><color=#e51717>COMMUNITY CONTENT</color></b>",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_blackknight"
	},
